cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this documentation, please cite it as below. Each linked repository has its own citation and DOI."
title: "AI-ready documentation for tricot. Linked literature, protocols and data for decentralized on-farm testing"
abstract: >-
  A family of repositories that makes the tricot approach accessible to people
  and AI assistants alike. Each repository covers one layer (literature,
  protocols, data, analysis) and ships a lightweight skill, so users
  can consult the team's published evidence, follow its standard procedures
  and work with its open trial data in one conversation.
